------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights - IMPORTANT
------------------------------------------------------------------------
LocalMusicGen does not ship model weights. Models are downloaded at runtime
from their upstream hosts at the user's request, and each carries its own
licence, which is shown in the Models view before download.

Those licences are NOT the Apache License and many are more restrictive than
it. 66 of the 136 catalogued models do not permit commercial use, among them
Meta's MusicGen and MAGNeT (CC-BY-NC-4.0), MiniMax Music 3, YuE2, LeVo 2,
SongGen, and the RAVE timbre models (IRCAM). The UVR separators carry no
formal licence at all, and each TONE3000 amp capture carries its author's own
terms, which travel with the file.

The Apache License covers this application's source code only. It grants no
rights whatsoever in any model, and confers no permission to use a model's
output commercially. Check the licence of any model whose output you intend to
release.
